message: "Please cite the associated article and this software release."
type: software
title: "Provenance-aware validation audit of public structural-engineering datasets"
version: "3.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Johnsonlijian/structural-ml-validation-target-mismatch"
url: "https://github.com/Johnsonlijian/structural-ml-validation-target-mismatch"
authors:
  - family-names: "REN"
    given-names: "Lijian"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1629-4368"
abstract: >-
  Audit and experiment code with aggregate results for a provenance-aware validation study across
  public structural-engineering datasets: configuration registry, fold-bound admissibility audit,
  size-matched controls, CFST feasibility boundary with an admissible repair, and an
  engineering-decision experiment. No third-party data are redistributed.
keywords:
  - validation protocol
  - provenance
  - data leakage
  - cross-validation
  - structural engineering
  - decision reliability
